eld. On the disposition of the fee, PER POL-NS-07 the rider's charge stands and the ruling value is DRIVER_COMPENSATION with amount_sgd mirroring the driver payment. All artifacts carry weight 1.0 and none is impaired under POL-NS-08: the arrival event matches the nearest GPS fix within seconds, the trace has no gap over 120 s (40 fixes, max gap 0 s) and includes the rider track, the chat log's 3 messages match trip_record.chat_message_count, and the SGD 4.00 cancellation-fee line reconciles with the fee schedule (the GREATER of the SGD 4.00 zone-class fee and the SGD 4.00 RYDE_X vehicle-tier fee). No POL-NS-09 trigger fires: confidence is above the 0.70 floor, no admissible artifacts contradict each other on arrival, dwell or rider presence, and the abuse counters (disputes_with_counterparty_90d 0 and 0; no_show_disputes_30d 0) are untripped. No clause produces a referral: POL-NS-05(ii) is not reached because the arrival marker is not false, and no anti-farming escalation packet is generated.",
